1
00:00:11,322 --> 00:00:17,534
Our quiet house is cold and still,
The brick walls feel so thick and high.

2
00:00:20,921 --> 00:00:27,064
An empty cup I cannot fill,
The television passing by.

3
00:00:29,903 --> 00:00:37,166
My chest is filled with broken glass,
The empty weeks are long and slow.

4
00:00:39,496 --> 00:00:46,285
Like leaden days that will not pass,
With burning fire down below.

5
00:00:49,723 --> 00:00:55,373
I hold a book I do not read,
To keep the heavy silence out.

6
00:00:57,524 --> 00:01:04,291
But your sweet laugh is what I need,
Instead of all this lonely doubt.

7
00:01:07,100 --> 00:01:14,542
Three weeks of trying to be strong,
Of putting on a laughing face.

8
00:01:16,701 --> 00:01:23,668
But every single breath was wrong,
Without your touch and warm embrace.

9
00:01:26,313 --> 00:01:35,759
I stand to sing inside the choir,
But every note is cold and dead.

10
00:01:35,944 --> 00:01:45,558
The music has no spark or fire,
Just empty, echoing words instead.

11
00:01:47,871 --> 00:01:55,583
I miss your chords, your perfect hand,
The timing that I used to hear.

12
00:01:57,433 --> 00:02:04,955
Just noise inside a space too grand,
Without your breathing standing near.

13
00:02:07,705 --> 00:02:13,666
I lie awake and watch the roof,
And count the seconds ticking past.

14
00:02:15,445 --> 00:02:22,873
My burning heart is crying proof,
This lonely nightmare cannot last.

15
00:02:25,085 --> 00:02:32,787
I miss the fire of your skin,
The secret worlds that we once shared.

16
00:02:34,851 --> 00:02:41,892
The quiet dark I'm trapped within,
And how we once so wildly dared.

